{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1766","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. MCF"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a graph consisting of $$$n$$$ vertices and $$$m$$$ directed arcs. The $$$i$$$-th arc goes from the vertex $$$x_i$$$ to the vertex $$$y_i$$$, has capacity $$$c_i$$$ and weight $$$w_i$$$. No arc goes into the vertex $$$1$$$, and no arc goes from the vertex $$$n$$$. There are no cycles of negative weight in the graph (it is impossible to travel from any vertex to itself in such a way that the total weight of all arcs you go through is negative)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to assign each arc a flow (an integer between $$$0$$$ and its capacity, inclusive). For every vertex "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"except $$$1$$$ and $$$n$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", the total flow on the arcs going to this vertex must be equal to the total flow on the arcs going from that vertex. Let the flow on the $$$i$$$-th arc be $$$f_i$$$, then the cost of the flow is equal to $$$\\sum \\limits_{i = 1}^{m} f_i w_i$$$. You have to find a flow which "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimizes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" the cost."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sounds classical, right? Well, we have some additional constraints on the flow on every edge:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$c_i$$$ is even, $$$f_i$$$ must be even; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$c_i$$$ is odd, $$$f_i$$$ must be odd. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Can you solve this problem?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 100$$$; $$$1 \\le m \\le 200$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$m$$$ lines follow. The $$$i$$$-th of them contains four integers $$$x_i$$$, $$$y_i$$$, $$$c_i$$$, and $$$w_i$$$ ($$$1 \\le x_i \\le n - 1$$$; $$$2 \\le y_i \\le n$$$; $$$x_i \\ne y_i$$$; $$$1 \\le c_i \\le 100$$$; $$$-100 \\le w_i \\le 100$$$). These integers describe the $$$i$$$-th arc."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Additional constraints on the input:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" there are no negative cycles in the graph. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If a flow satisfying all of the constraints does not exist, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Impossible"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Otherwise, print two lines:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the first line should contain one word "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Possible"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the second line should contain $$$m$$$ integers $$$f_1, f_2, \\dots, f_m$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are multiple answers, print any of them. Note that the cost of the flow should be minimized."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 3\n1 2 3 -10\n1 2 3 -15\n2 3 2 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nPossible\n1 1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 3\n1 2 3 -10\n1 2 3 -15\n2 3 3 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nImpossible\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 3\n1 2 3 -10\n1 2 3 -15\n2 3 4 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nPossible\n1 3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6 7\n5 6 9 -40\n1 2 3 -10\n1 4 5 20\n4 5 7 30\n2 5 1 -15\n1 3 3 5\n3 5 3 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nPossible\n5 1 1 1 1 3 3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1766F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1766/problem/F"}